   "he": "״מְכַשֵּׁפָה לֹא תְחַיֶּה״, וּכְתִיב: ״כׇּל שֹׁכֵב עִם בְּהֵמָה מוֹת יוּמָת״. כֹּל שֶׁיֶּשְׁנוֹ בִּכְלַל ״כׇּל שֹׁכֵב עִם בְּהֵמָה״ – יֶשְׁנוֹ בִּכְלַל ״מְכַשֵּׁפָה לֹא תְחַיֶּה״.",
   "en": "«“You shall not allow a witch to live”» (Exodus 22:17), «and it is written» in the following verse: «“Whoever lies with an animal shall be put to death”» (Exodus 22:18). It is derived from here that «anyone who is included in» the prohibition of: «“Whoever lies with an animal,”» including gentiles, «is included in» the command: «“You shall not allow a witch to live.”»"
  }
